  <name>CloudStream</name>
  <summary>Play media from user-selected extensions</summary>
  <description>
    <p>CloudStream is an extension-based media center. Browse, search, and play content supplied by compatible providers selected by the user.</p>
    <p>The Linux client runs compatible provider extensions in a separate JVM process and uses a native Qt interface.</p>
  </description>
